<title>LATVIA: MISA PEAT Q2 PROFIT 12,879 LATS.</title>
<headline>MISA PEAT Q2 PROFIT 12,879 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange said on Monday that the second quarter profit of Misa Peat was 12,879 lats on turnover of 230,099 lats.</p>
<p>The bourse gave no comparisons for the figure. The company had production expenses of 156,679 lats and a gross profit of 73,420 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
